### GET all stays
GET {{BookStay.API_HostAddress}}/api/stays
Accept: application/json

###

### GET stay by ID
GET {{BookStay.API_HostAddress}}/api/stays/1
Accept: application/json

###

### POST new stay
POST {{BookStay.API_HostAddress}}/api/stays
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 6,
  "name": "Stay 6",
  "address": "Address 6",
  "city": "City 6",
  "country": "Country 6",
  "rating": "5 Stars",
  "imageUrl": "ImageUrl 6"
}

###

### PUT update stay
PUT {{BookStay.API_HostAddress}}/api/stays/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Updated Stay 1",
  "address": "Updated Address 1",
  "city": "City 1",
  "country": "Country 1",
  "rating": "4 Stars",
  "imageUrl": "ImageUrl 1"
}

###

### DELETE stay
DELETE {{BookStay.API_HostAddress}}/api/stays/1

